# Environment variables (optional)

Copy to `.env` for local experiments. **Never commit `.env`.**

The packaged app does not load this file; Electron / electron-builder read process env at build or runtime.

```bash
# Code signing (local `npm run dist` / `npm run release` only)
# CSC_LINK=
# CSC_KEY_PASSWORD=
# WIN_PUBLISHER_NAME=

# Publish to GitHub Releases from your machine
# GH_TOKEN=

# Force signing failure when certs are missing (CI sets this)
# YAMI_REQUIRE_SIGNING=1
```
